</pre><h2>Análise&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;O&nbsp;Impacto&nbsp;Real:&nbsp;A&nbsp;Casa&nbsp;Traçada&nbsp;e&nbsp;as&nbsp;Raízes&nbsp;Ancestrais</h2><p>Após&nbsp;uma&nbsp;passagem&nbsp;temporária&nbsp;por&nbsp;centros&nbsp;espíritas&nbsp;kardecistas&nbsp;em&nbsp;busca&nbsp;do&nbsp;princípio&nbsp;da&nbsp;caridade,&nbsp;o&nbsp;reencontro&nbsp;com&nbsp;a&nbsp;própria&nbsp;vocação&nbsp;ocorreu&nbsp;ao&nbsp;ingressar&nbsp;em&nbsp;uma&nbsp;nova&nbsp;casa&nbsp;traçada&nbsp;—&nbsp;isto&nbsp;é,&nbsp;um&nbsp;terreiro&nbsp;que&nbsp;une&nbsp;a&nbsp;liturgia&nbsp;fluida&nbsp;da&nbsp;Umbanda&nbsp;aos&nbsp;fundamentos&nbsp;estruturais&nbsp;e&nbsp;litúrgicos&nbsp;do&nbsp;Candomblé.</p><pre data-language="plain">
